1
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:18,000
Citizens, the National Convention, trusting in your courage, hereby accepts your oaths of loyalty.

2
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:22,980
The liberty of your homeland will be the reward for your efforts.

3
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:32,660
And while you defend your liberty with the force of your arms, the National Convention will defend it by the force of the laws.

4
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,880
