5
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:47,780
So that, Dominic, was yet another person shouting loudly, one of many in our ongoing history of the French Revolution.

6
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:56,060
And it was specifically Jérôme Pétillan, who was president of the National Convention on the 21st of September 1792.

7
00:00:56,300 --> 00:01:02,660
And obviously, the abolition of the French monarchy after centuries and centuries and centuries.

8
