So on the 20th of September, so that's the day before the reading that you began with, the new National Convention meets for the first time.

55
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:32,300
Now, some listeners, if they've made it all the way through the series, may be like, I've lost track of all the different assemblies and whatnot.

56
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:36,200
So if you remember, there had been the stormy, the tuileries.

57
