And.

88
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,460
And lots of throwing of cats.

89
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:14,040
Well, similarly, in France, for the national convention, the voting is public and it is oral.

90
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:16,500
You vote, you know, you say who you want to vote for.

91
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:24,620
So if you want to vote in favor of a royalist party, you're basically standing up and saying, I am a reactionary traitor to La Patrie in front of all your fellow villagers.

92
00:05:24,900 --> 00:05:32,700
I mean, it's not who are like holding clubs and stuff and sort of leering at you in a sinister way.

93
00:05:32,820 --> 00:05:35,320
So clearly a lot of people just don't want to turn out.

94
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:40,580
So in Paris, the voting has coincided with the September massacres.

95
00:05:40,580 --> 00:05:43,080
That's what we began this little kind of miniseries with.

96
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:50,000
So the atmosphere is very grim because as people are voting, there is the kind of stepping over corpses, right?

97
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:55,520
The dull sound of hacking coming from inside the walls of the converted convent just down the road.

98
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,040
So what is worse?

99
00:05:58,080 --> 00:06:02,040
The second round of voting is held at the Jacobin Club.

