00:06:02,380 --> 00:06:05,160
So if you are a royalist or reactionary.

101
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:09,500
This is not the ideal place to go and to sort of pin your colors to the mast.

102
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:20,240
And that round of voting, the Jacobin Club, they've got a lot of kind of electors, but they start by agreeing that they'll purge all electors who are foyant, who are moderates or who are royalists.

103
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,900
So 200 electors are kicked out.

104
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:25,240
